msgctxt "328"
msgid "Hello there, sir. What can I help you with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Hopefully a lot. I'm looking for some children's clothes,\r\n"
"and maybe an accessory to go with them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Just a moment, sir. Allow me to show you what we have in\r\n"
"stock."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "(...Pretty limited selection. What should I pick?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "I'll take the American flag polo. Gotta love the U.S. of A."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "I'll take that dragon print polo. Nothing quite like a dragon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Excellent choice, sir. And for the accessory?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "(Only two options again? Guess I'll go with...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "I'll go with the ten gallon hat. The bigger the better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "I'll go with the sunglasses. Not much cooler than that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Very good, sir."
msgstr "Molto bene, signore."

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"The American flag polo and the sunglasses comes out to\r\n"
"2,000 yen, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
