"2,000 yen, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"I don't mean to be rude, sir... but it appears you don't have\r\n"
"enough money for these. Please come back when you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Actually, I changed my mind. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "Not a problem at all, sir. Please come again."
msgstr "Nessun problema, signore. Torni a trovarci."

